<article>

    <p>
        South Korea is one of my favourite countries, and studying there
        is one of my biggest dreams. I have always been interested in
        Korean culture, education, technology and lifestyle.
    </p>

    <p>
        Through <strong>Study & Seoul</strong>, I want to share my
        learning journey, goals, experiences and everything I discover
        along the way.
    </p>

    <h2>🇰🇷 Why I Like South Korea</h2>

    <p>
        My interest in South Korea started with Korean culture, language,
        traditions, food and lifestyle. I became curious about the country
        and wanted to learn more about it.
    </p>

    <p>
        I also enjoy learning the Korean language. I practice Hangul,
        learn new Korean words and sentences, watch Korean videos and
        listen to Korean songs.
    </p>

    <h2>📚 Why I Want to Study in South Korea</h2>

    <p>
        I want to study in an international environment where I can learn
        new things and meet people from different backgrounds.
    </p>

    <p>
        South Korea interests me because of its universities, modern
        education system, technology and international environment.
    </p>

    <p>
        As a commerce student, I am particularly interested in:
    </p>

    <ul>
        <li>Finance</li>
        <li>Accounting</li>
        <li>Business</li>
        <li>International Business</li>
        <li>Management</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>💼 My Career Goals</h2>

    <p>
        I want to build a career in finance and accounting. My long-term
        goal is to work in an international company and develop professional
        skills that can help me build a successful career.
    </p>

    <p>
        I also want to improve my English and Korean communication skills.
        I believe that language skills, financial knowledge and computer
        skills can help me become more confident professionally.
    </p>

    <h2>🌆 Places I Want to Visit in Seoul</h2>

    <p>
        Seoul is the first city in South Korea that I would love to explore.
        There are many places I want to experience.
    </p>

    <ul>
        <li>Bukchon Hanok Village 🏘️</li>
        <li>Myeongdong 🛍️</li>
        <li>Hongdae 🎶</li>
        <li>Korean universities 🎓</li>
        <li>Traditional markets</li>
        <li>Cultural and historical places</li>
    </ul>

    <p>
        I would also love to wear a traditional Hanbok, take photographs
        and experience Korean traditions.
    </p>

    <h2>🍜 Korean Food I Want to Try</h2>

    <p>
        Food is another interesting part of experiencing a new culture.
        I would like to try Korean dishes such as:
    </p>

    <ul>
        <li>Gimbap</li>
        <li>Tteokbokki</li>
        <li>Hotteok</li>
        <li>Vegetarian Korean snacks</li>
    </ul>

    <p>
        Since I am interested in vegetarian food, I would also like to
        explore vegetarian-friendly Korean food options.
    </p>

    <h2>🌱 My Learning Journey</h2>

    <p>
        I know that reaching my goal will take time and effort. I need to
        continue improving my education, English, Korean language skills,
        financial knowledge and professional skills.
    </p>

    <p>
        I believe that small steps every day can help me move closer to
        my dream.
    </p>

